OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSANo fines handed out in first month
OL,4,Aof balaclava ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottinghamshire Police said two people
OL,7,Fwere stopped in the first month and the
OL,8,Flack of fines showed "the message is
OL,9,Fgetting through".
OL,11,FCity commander Supt Chris Pearson said
OL,12,Fthe ban itself had led to fewer people
OL,13,Fwearing masks and the lack of fines
OL,14,Fshowed it was working as a deterrent.
